# The season ledger is APPEND-ONLY and is written by Linux CI and read on
# Windows. Without this, a Windows checkout gets CRLF, an append writes LF,
# and the file ends up with mixed endings — which turns "one commit added
# these lines" into a diff nobody can read. LF in the working tree
# everywhere keeps every append a pure addition.
season_ledger/*.jsonl text eol=lf
data/seasons/**/*.json text eol=lf
